Context: 4. Items of 'Fees' subject to payment of share to Government-

- (ii) Fees received to perform, with permission, clerical, administrative or technical work of an occasional or casual nature for a private body including a private body engaged in literary, cultural, artistic, scientific, charitable or sports activities as also co-operative societies and other registered societies;
- (iii) Income received for publishing a book or contributing an article on subjects other than literary, cultural, technological and scientific subjects (including management sciences);
